etween $h$ and $T$ are `{13, 17, 18, 19, 21, 24, 26, 29}`.\nThere are exactly 8 common bits. The parity of 8 is 0, so $c = 0$.\n\n<answer>[757999644,0]</answer>", "error": null, "elapsed_sec": 94.26, "http_status": 200, "finish_reason": "stop", "preset": "hard", "escalation_round": 2}
