Rejected honestly: the paper does not yield an acceptable family under the required gates.

The native APN-graph hyperplane family cleared G and V, but failed H:

- Track A is invalid because binary Gaussian elimination recovers the witness in polynomial time.
- Track B failed the oracle loop. Even the final 281-operation escalation was solved exactly, producing `too_easy`.
- Mechanical cost: 59,719,418 bit operations, 1.918 seconds.
- Compact route: 281 operations.

Full evidence and paper-section analysis are in [REJECTED.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2411.12911/REJECTED.md). The construction was based on Proposition 1.5 and Corollaries 3.4–3.6 of the [paper](https://arxiv.org/html/2411.12911v3).

